  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCALE Monitoring and Evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide services in both monitoring and evaluation of the SCALE programme that will combine to build a strong evidence base for programme learning and accountability. Overall, the objective is to assess the extent to which the design and implementation of the SCALE programme supports SCALE&#x2019;s proposed Pathway for Scaling Learning Outcomes</narrative>
  </description>
